 "body_html": "<pre><code>double* sol = (double*) calloc(n_samp, sizeof(double));\ndouble** m = (double**) calloc(n_samp, sizeof(double*));\nfor (int i = 0; i &lt; n_samp; i++){\n    *(m+i) = (double*) calloc((n_samp + 1), sizeof(double));\n}\n</code></pre>\n\n<p>I am generating a 2D array using the above. It works fine but valgrind is telling me that there's a memory leak. What is the proper way to free the memories here?</p>\n",
